        "core_px": 3,
        "glow_px": 8,
        "role": "primary",
        "gradient": "hairline"
      },
      "f0": "line 2 reveals left to right from f2-3 (0.08 s): soft-edged wipe + blur 8 -> 0, 6 f expo-out, the hairline drawing L -> R with it; line 1 from f11-12 (0.38 s): character-by-character L -> R reveal (~1 f per char, each blur 8 -> 0 + grey -> white over 4 f); settled and readable by f22-24 (0.75-0.8 s) [v02 @ 0.05-0.85 s, full-rate strip]",
      "exit": "F-A: none (holds to the last frame); F-B: hard cut with the whole hook composition",
      "text_class": "TC-display"
    },
